 "intro": "Eight bit cells b7 to b0 with the binary point between b3 and b2. Weights above the point are 16, 8, 4, 2, 1; below it ½, ¼, ⅛. The pattern 01011.010 is 8 + 2 + 1 + ¼ = 11.25. The format covers 0 to 31.875 in steps of ⅛.",
